    "detailed_description": "<h1>Free Weekend</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Closed Beta Test for Rust Rides \u2013 Registration Open!</strong> \ud83d\ude80</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are launching the selection process for the <strong>closed beta version</strong> of our game <strong>Rust Rides</strong>!<br>Priority will be given to <strong>press representatives, bloggers, streamers, and content creators</strong>, but anyone can apply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>How it works:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill out the form at this link: <strong>REGISTRATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will review your profile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who meet our criteria will receive access to the <strong>Steam Playtest</strong> or a <strong>key for Early Access</strong> to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Hurry</strong> \u2014 the number of spots in the test is limited!<br><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f Attention:</strong><br>By submitting this form, you automatically consent to the processing of the personal data you have provided in the form.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras/de7f8796804645459d424a2e26c2bb6b.avif?t=1755669330\" width=523 height=161 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Rust Rides: Adventure on Wheels</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Survival. Racing. Cars with soul.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get behind the wheel of a time-worn car and set off on an open journey through rural expanses, where every kilometer can change your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Rust Rides, you don't just drive \u2014 you learn to survive, trade, collect equipment, build your base, and compete in races with other travelers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >______________________________________________________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Game world:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start, you only have an old car, a little fuel, and a map with suggested routes. The rest is up to luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your first spare parts, negotiate with a dealer, trade metal for a wheel, upgrade your engine, and move on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has no fixed storyline \u2014 the world reacts to your actions. You can focus on racing, repairs, trading, or simply exploring the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >______________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras/d8d005314f8b3f8b8fcf7ab4c3ec11b5.poster.avif?t=1755669330\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras/d8d005314f8b3f8b8fcf7ab4c3ec11b5.webm?t=1755669330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras/d8d005314f8b3f8b8fcf7ab4c3ec11b5.mp4?t=1755669330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Key features:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect and modify cars:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro, experimental, quirky \u2014 each one has its own character. Buy, assemble from spare parts, and upgrade to suit your needs: for racing, trading, or traveling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take part in races:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test the power of your car on different tracks \u2014 from country roads to abandoned concrete roads. Win rewards, resources, and prestige.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and upgrade:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources, repair, tune cars, and even rebuild your own base. Start with a shack \u2014 develop it into a real auto repair shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live trading with NPCs:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade metal, nuts, auto parts, or even cars themselves. The market responds to demand \u2014 find your niche.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up your character:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From driving skills to master craftsman skills \u2014 everything affects your chances in the game world. Every action leaves a mark on your history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An open world with a Ukrainian vibe:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through picturesque locations \u2014 quiet villages, abandoned gas stations, craft markets, and techno zones. Every place is a new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >______________________________________________________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Rust Rides is about you:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to be a trader who turned a garage into an empire?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love speed and can't live without racing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe you like collecting old cars and restoring them to perfection?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your path here is <u>unlimited.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >______________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No unnecessary hype. No forced storyline.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Just the world, cars, and you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Survive. Compete. Live on the road.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras/5974a1bd40ac440a5da59fd9ca0b5a79.avif?t=1755669330\" width=543 height=379 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras/de7f8796804645459d424a2e26c2bb6b.avif?t=1755669330\" width=523 height=161 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Rust Rides: Adventure on Wheels</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Survival. Racing. Cars with soul.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get behind the wheel of a time-worn car and set off on an open journey through rural expanses, where every kilometer can change your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Rust Rides, you don't just drive \u2014 you learn to survive, trade, collect equipment, build your base, and compete in races with other travelers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >______________________________________________________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Game world:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start, you only have an old car, a little fuel, and a map with suggested routes. The rest is up to luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your first spare parts, negotiate with a dealer, trade metal for a wheel, upgrade your engine, and move on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has no fixed storyline \u2014 the world reacts to your actions. You can focus on racing, repairs, trading, or simply exploring the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >______________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras/d8d005314f8b3f8b8fcf7ab4c3ec11b5.poster.avif?t=1755669330\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras/d8d005314f8b3f8b8fcf7ab4c3ec11b5.webm?t=1755669330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras/d8d005314f8b3f8b8fcf7ab4c3ec11b5.mp4?t=1755669330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Key features:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect and modify cars:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro, experimental, quirky \u2014 each one has its own character. Buy, assemble from spare parts, and upgrade to suit your needs: for racing, trading, or traveling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take part in races:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test the power of your car on different tracks \u2014 from country roads to abandoned concrete roads. Win rewards, resources, and prestige.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and upgrade:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources, repair, tune cars, and even rebuild your own base. Start with a shack \u2014 develop it into a real auto repair shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live trading with NPCs:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade metal, nuts, auto parts, or even cars themselves. The market responds to demand \u2014 find your niche.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up your character:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From driving skills to master craftsman skills \u2014 everything affects your chances in the game world. Every action leaves a mark on your history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An open world with a Ukrainian vibe:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through picturesque locations \u2014 quiet villages, abandoned gas stations, craft markets, and techno zones. Every place is a new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >______________________________________________________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Rust Rides is about you:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to be a trader who turned a garage into an empire?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love speed and can't live without racing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe you like collecting old cars and restoring them to perfection?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your path here is <u>unlimited.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >______________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No unnecessary hype. No forced storyline.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Just the world, cars, and you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Survive. Compete. Live on the road.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras/5974a1bd40ac440a5da59fd9ca0b5a79.avif?t=1755669330\" width=543 height=379 /></span></p>",
